        "text_cJFGQx": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Agvana began with a dream: crafting jewelry that speaks of love, the joy of gift-giving, and more. We believe in making meaningful and stylish pieces accessible to all.  In the world of Agvana, we understand the power of dreams, love, and the language of thoughtful gifts. Our collection is not just jewelry; it's a heartfelt expression, a timeless gift that captures your sentiments. Experience the beauty of emotions with Agvana, where each piece is a testament to your unique connection.</p>",
